      "start_seconds": 0.88,
      "end_seconds": 6.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Hmm, good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.59,
      "end_seconds": 11.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "you're alright, take a seat what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.92,
      "end_seconds": 20.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "Right, you know, good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.88,
      "end_seconds": 26.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down we'll go through it together"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 28.27,
      "end_seconds": 34.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "it's itchy blisters, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.25,
      "end_seconds": 38.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.18,
      "end_seconds": 57.68,
      "duration_seconds": 16.5,
      "text": "probably six months yeah hmm, and raw areas where blisters burst as well, since this morning. An itchy rash first was there, but it's gone away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.76,
      "end_seconds": 61.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.88,
      "end_seconds": 67.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Yeah, um, I haven't noticed any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 69.84,
      "end_seconds": 74.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.84,
      "end_seconds": 83.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.49,
      "end_seconds": 95.13,
      "duration_seconds": 9.64,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and and what you've noticed. A few quick ones: mouth sores, new medicine or eye problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.61,
      "end_seconds": 100.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "No, you know, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.67,
      "end_seconds": 106.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.81,
      "end_seconds": 111.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Actually, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.87,
      "end_seconds": 114.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.66,
      "end_seconds": 118.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.22,
      "end_seconds": 132.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "okay, anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.11,
      "end_seconds": 138.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "I had a varicose vein procedure last year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.74,
      "end_seconds": 143.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.88,
      "end_seconds": 149.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.75,
      "end_seconds": 153.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.5,
      "end_seconds": 159.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.13,
      "end_seconds": 165.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.84,
      "end_seconds": 171.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.97,
      "end_seconds": 182.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "Right, anything in your past medical history I should know? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.49,
      "end_seconds": 188.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Hmm, I have high blood pressure, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.84,
      "end_seconds": 191.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.36,
      "end_seconds": 196.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I have an enlarged prostate, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.72,
      "end_seconds": 203.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Ah. Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.57,
      "end_seconds": 210.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Let me think, no, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 211.06,
      "end_seconds": 219.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "Actually, I'm not sure that's right. I seem to recall a problem with erythromycin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.22,
      "end_seconds": 223.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Right, really? I don't think so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.59,
      "end_seconds": 232.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "Alright, so that's unclear. I'll record what each of you said. Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.2,
      "end_seconds": 237.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "my sister had breast cancer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.51,
      "end_seconds": 251.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.94,
      "end_seconds": 264.17,
      "duration_seconds": 10.23,
      "text": "It's, It's lisinopril, 10 milligrams, once a day for my pressure. Tamsulosin. I take it 0.4 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.05,
      "end_seconds": 266.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "And for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.44,
      "end_seconds": 270.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Two months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.88,
      "end_seconds": 274.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "time for your numbers, if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.56,
      "end_seconds": 289.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "that's it, just a little longer.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.21,
      "end_seconds": 314.05,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temperature is 36.5 degrees. And respiratory rate 14, BP is 119 over 76, pulse is 78 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.94,
      "end_seconds": 316.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.31,
      "end_seconds": 322.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.89,
      "end_seconds": 354.73,
      "duration_seconds": 19.84,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: The most likely explanation is bullous pemphigoid. I can't rule out pemphigus yet. There's nothing new for me to start or arrange today. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.44,
      "end_seconds": 361.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "okay, so good, thanks, I'll see you then"
    }
  ]
